# Frame numbers are VBlank frames from cold boot/reset.
# Syntax:
#   tap FRAME KEYS [DURATION]
#   at FRAME KEYS [DURATION]
#   wait FRAMES
#   tap KEYS [DURATION]
#
# Current Ruby probe: skip around the early Game Freak/title window,
# then tap A/Start at wider intervals to look for menu entry.
tap 520 Start 6
tap 760 Start 6
tap 920 A 6
tap 1100 A 6
tap 1350 Start 6
tap 1600 A 6
